<title>SOUTH KOREA: TRIGEM COMPUTER H1 NET FALLS.</title>
<headline>TRIGEM COMPUTER H1 NET FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Share (won)				   696 vs 795</p>
<p>    Net					    3.13 vs 5.48</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			  3.57 vs 9.29</p>
<p>    Turnover				   300.02 vs 387.65</p>
<p>Note - Trigem Computer Inc, one of South Korea's leading personal computer manufacturers, said its shares increased by 2.07 million to 8.99 million at the end of June from a year ago.</p>
</text>
